  "_sDescription": "Old school is best school",
  "_bGenerateTableOfContents": false,
  "_sText": "Hey all! I took a bit of a break from modding, but I had this passion project that I had been working on for the last few years.\u00a0 I was finally able to complete it.\u00a0 This idea had been something I wanted to do for a long time, and I understand it may not be for everyone.<br><br>This pack replaces most weapons within CSS with popular mods from years ago.\u00a0 Most everything in this pack is close to 20 years old, but everything has been animated and compiled by me.\u00a0 I have not tested to see if everything works online and there are a few bugs still in this pack, but hopefully it works for everyone.\u00a0 If there are any major problems with the pack or the credits let me know and I'll do my best to fix it.\u00a0 \u00a0The Zip file includes a \"custom\" folder.\u00a0 Place that folder in your counter-strike: Source/cstrike folder.",
